      "t": "html",
      "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> AddOcspResponse <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CRYPT_50124\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Cryptography.pdf)\">[SWS_CRYPT_50124]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=RS_CRYPTO_02306\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf)\">RS_CRYPTO_02306</a></span></h3>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">virtual <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">ara::core::Result</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_crypto_ara_crypto_x509_6a3cad.html#SWS_CRYPT_40203\">CertificateValidationStatus</a> &gt; AddOcsp Response (OcspResponse::Sptrc ocspResponse, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Optional_27f98b.html\">ara::core::Optional</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_crypto_x509_Certificate_922056.html\">Certificate</a>::Sptrc &gt; trustedOcspIssuerCertificate) noexcept=0;</pre>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Validate and add an OCSP response to be used during certificate validation to the set of previously added OCSP responses. Multiple OCSP responses may be added to one context. In order to validate the OCSP response, the issuer of the OCSP response must have been a) set as a trusted or untrusted certificate in this context previously, or b) the CRL must have been signed by another certificate that has the id-kp-OCSPSigning extended key usage set issued by the same CA, or c) the CRL must be signed by a trusted CA passed to this function using the optional trustedOcspIssuerCertificate parameter.</p></div>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
